&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Senior Operational Excellence Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the architect of efficiency for our Australia and New Zealand markets. Sitting at the intersection of Planning, FSQA, Procurement, and Fulfillment, you will define our Target Operating Model (TOM) and drive the strategic framework that ensures our end-to-end (E2E) supply chain is lean, scalable, and resilient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in &lt;strong&gt;Chippendale, Sydney&lt;/strong&gt; and reports to the &lt;strong&gt;Associate Director of Operations Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
