&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3823 - Associate, SEO, GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role exists within WPP Medias Global Client Solutions to support a growing team, covering both SEO and AI Discoverability. As an SEO Associate, you will play a pivotal role in day-to-day support, and in some cases ownership, of client engagements, SEO process and execution on and off page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SEO Associate will be required to support the growth of our offering with the help of the Account Manager and lead in management of the SEO Associate in the team. The SEO Associate will help to support and shape the global SEO strategy for a variety of brands across content, technical and outreach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The candidate should have an action-based attitude and strong time management skills to best support the SEO team. The candidate should be comfortable in presenting their findings and be confident across the core pillars of SEO and have the ambition to consistently expand their skill set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Essential Criteria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an understanding in areas of Owned Media such as SEO (websites, site analytics and mobile environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective and efficient working style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of on page and off page SEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative thinking around content for digital&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of site analytics and SEO tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised and has a great attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in search and digital media and advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language skills desired but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desirable Criteria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building Looker Studio reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building deliverable templates for the team to utilise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Delivering client performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee development and creation of organic search best practices alongside your BD. Ultimate accountability for adherence to best practice, and responsible for effective oversight of designated organic and holistic search strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create from briefs client specific search landscapes and content topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the benchmark reporting and analysis of client campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SEO copy writing and optimisation to support the content strategy for global and local teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct technical and content audits and provide recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with reporting tools to analyse performance and provide recommendations with the support of senior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an understanding of the services we offer and how we offer them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop skill sets to become an expert in search marketing, across both paid search, programmatic, SEO and paid social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Driving our process&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct outreach execution approach at a global level and help coordinate this in regional/local markets via the strategy agreed by SEO directors and the global client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality control deliverables with senior team members in order to confidently provide documentation to clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within a timely manner to meet client &amp;amp; internal expectations and deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspiring our people&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Owned Media POVs for regular client updates to your manager to support campaign actions, reporting and strategies discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively communicate with your Manager, client team and client contacts regarding deadlines and delivery of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train Grads and Executives on how to effectively and execute an efficient SEO plan and how to apply best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Associate Executive with tasks, providing guidance where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3980 - Associate Director, Planning, UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP 650&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join an award-winning team at the heart of UK government, where your work will genuinely shape lives. As part of WPP 650 you’ll be part of a supportive, collaborative environment that values curiosity, kindness, and growth. Together, we use behaviour change principles to design smarter services, influence better decisions, and help millions of people across the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Named WPP 650, after the 650 UK constituencies, the name is a reminder that our work must reflect the full breadth of the country, every community, every audience. No two days are the same. The challenges are complex, the problems worth solving, and the learning constant. You’ll tackle issues that matter, alongside talented colleagues who care deeply about what they do. It’s demanding – but always rewarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP 650 is a bespoke agency unit within WPP, dedicated to serving the evolving communications needs of government clients. We bring together the best of WPP&#39;s talent, technology, and insights to deliver impactful, modern, and effective public communications. We are at the forefront of reimagining how government engages with its citizens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is meaningful work with real-world impact – the kind you can point to with pride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP has a vision of world-class communications, and since recently we have been moving to a combined agency model including Media, Creative, PR, Data &amp;amp; CRM agency partners to build a team from the best people in the industry to work in partnership with our clients.&amp;nbsp; This is a huge opportunity to be part of an industry changing dynamic that makes a genuine difference through communications. Joining the team will give the person who takes this role a real opportunity to champion digital as a key driver to the success of this new model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in our new WPP campus building in the heart of Manchester’s development district, the largest communications operation outside of London and the home for all WPP regional talent across a number of business disciplines, and an amazing place to grow your communications career and to realise your potential in a dynamic and exciting setting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Director, Clients&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3 best things about the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Exciting brands with unlimited possibilities and a broad scope for ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A truly diverse community feel to the team, the client, and the work we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pivotal responsibility in planning and managing all media lines across offline and online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In three months, you would have: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboarded fully on to the accounts and met all the key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully understanding the processes across the account and key outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built strong relationships with Media team and local senior clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked closely with the BD to review ways of working processes and develop client growth plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taken on responsibility of&amp;nbsp;managing the quality of the work that is taken to the client and ensuring all reporting and finance processes and timings are adhered to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivating our internal teams to produce great work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In six months, you would have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become the ‘go to’ for senior clients. Become their trusted point person.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managed&amp;nbsp;and delivered annual planning across the account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managed&amp;nbsp;the development of exceptional,&amp;nbsp;award-winning&amp;nbsp;planning work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised as a go-to source of energy and insight in the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivered&amp;nbsp;several&amp;nbsp;responses, with data and evidence led insights, ambitious innovation opportunities to push things forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spotted&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;commercial&amp;nbsp;opportunity for us to do things better,&amp;nbsp;that would benefit the client and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managed&amp;nbsp;and developed&amp;nbsp;your team, ensuring they are performing at their full potential and looking out for their wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agreed objectives with your BD to ensure constant progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributed to&amp;nbsp;WPP 650 culture in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;team – great planners with clear goals, objectives, and development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Got involved in wider&amp;nbsp;business unit&amp;nbsp;workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 12 months, you would have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a key stakeholder in your clients’ business. Leading and executing their vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developed the client business and contributed to its growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the business working with key stakeholders across the WPP Media network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead RTBs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seeking new revenue workstreams to grow the account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a reporting and financial processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To be a true team player where you enjoy building relationships with clients and our colleagues around the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of all media and experience of end to end planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A digital first approach to planning with a fast-growing tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive attitude and willingness to develop talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A motivational leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
